<p><strong>Financial:</strong> Infrastructure CAPEX at global scale is substantial. Terminal distribution model and financing structure remain undefined, creating uncertainty in payback projections.</p>
<p><strong>Operational:</strong> Partnership with telecommunications operators is essential for deployment but not yet initiated. Regulatory approvals for enterprise and government segments will require extended timelines.</p></section>
