<p>| Portability | Compact unit; mountable on robotic platforms |</p></section>
<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Architecture and Components</h2><p>High-intensity UV pulse generator; UV lamp array; pulse control electronics; integrated pathogenic-air locator (pre/post-treatment verification); operator interface; safety interlocks; mains/battery power supply. Modular, deployable standalone or on mobile platform.</p></section>
<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Advantages</h2><p>Technical: instant pathogen elimination; 100% efficacy; no consumables; no residual chemicals; safe for humans/animals; automated. Economic: rapid deployment; no ongoing treatment costs; single-operator control; reusable across multiple locations. Environmental: zero chemical discharge; no waste byproducts. Strategic: pandemic-ready; applicable to multiple pathogen types; no global analogs; export potential.</p></section>
