<p>Users: retailers, distribution/logistics operators, food processors.</p>',
            'solution' => '<p>ARBOK-3X is a pulsed UVC sanitization system that extends the shelf life of packaged perishables by 20–50 % using high-intensity pulsed UVC irradiation from a xenon flash lamp source. Non-contact and ambient-temperature, it lets supermarkets, distribution centers, and warehouses cut food waste, improve profitability, and enhance food safety — with no chemicals, consumables, or residue. Core idea: &quot;Save to Earn&quot; — every 1 % reduction in food loss is direct economic gain.</p>
<p>Pulsed UVC light damages microbial DNA/RNA, inactivating spoilage organisms (Erwinia, Pseudomonas, Botrytis cinerea, molds, yeasts, fungal spores). Pulsed delivery gives high-intensity treatment without overheating, with exposure time per item tuned short enough to keep line throughput fast. Treated products retain color, texture, and nutrition. Non-contact, ambient temperature.</p>
<p>Limitations: surface treatment only (line-of-sight UVC; shadowed areas untreated); does not penetrate opaque packaging; complements but does not replace refrigeration.</p>',
            'market_opportunity' => '<p>Retail food waste is enormous (often ~30 % spoilage on fresh produce). A non-contact, consumable-free shelf-life extender with sub-12-month ROI addresses supermarkets, distribution, and post-harvest globally. Example: a retailer with $10M/year fruit sales and 30 % spoilage ($3M) saving 50 % = $1.5M/year.</p>
<p>OPEX &lt;$0.001/kg (no consumables); ROI &lt;12 months for an average distribution center; retail savings ~15 % of revenue via up-to-50 % waste reduction. Payback example: $1.5M/year savings on $10M fruit sales.</p>',
            'use_cases' => '<p>Pre-packaging and post-harvest sanitization on production lines; bulk treatment of high-volume SKUs at distribution centers; on-site freshness extension before retail display; complement to cold storage/logistics. Mountable as conveyor integration, UV tunnel, or static chamber.</p>
<p>Users: retailers, distribution/logistics operators, food processors.</p>
<p>Rapid plug-and-play deployment; site evaluation → installation → staff training → ROI modeling/monitoring. Customizable integration into existing lines or stores.</p>
<p>Drop-in for production lines, DCs, retail, and cold-storage hubs; conveyor/tunnel/chamber form factors; complements refrigeration and ARBOK FoodTech retail platforms.</p>',
            'technology_readiness_level' => 'TRL 9',
            'current_stage' => 'Deployment-ready',
            'investor_status' => 'Available for partnership and technical diligence discussion',
            'ip_patent_status' => 'Public version — proprietary process detail withheld',
