<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Typical Project Economics</h2><p>Detailed CAPEX, OPEX, production cost, product price, and payback figures for ALA are not yet published. The economic case rests on the underlying TEG cost advantage: affordable TEG produced by the Arbok-TEG technology turns materials that were previously either fabulously expensive or unavailable in the required quantities into a mass-production raw material with a high yield at industrial volumes.</p></section>
<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Risk Factors</h2><p><strong>Stated in the source:</strong></p>
