<p>OPEX dominated by 0.65–0.85 kWh/m³ energy; no consumables. Savings from eliminated concentrate hauling/storage and avoided fines; residue offtake optional upside. (Site-specific CAPEX/payback to be modelled.)</p>',
            'use_cases' => '<p>Primary use cases: municipal landfill leachate; rainy-season / snowmelt overflow control; remote landfill sites; full ZLD retrofit.</p>
