<p>Scale: self-contained modules, single site to multi-module cascades.</p>
<p>Steps: leachate characterization → module sizing → on-site install → commissioning. Open-air, ambient temperature. Continuous, automated, minimal staffing.</p>
<p>Retrofits to existing landfill leachate ponds and ZLD infrastructure; SCADA/PLC ready; pairs with adjacent ARBOK vacuum platforms.</p>',
