<p>• Remote monitoring, KPI reporting</p>
<p>• Predictive maintenance</p></section>
<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Deployment &amp; Operation</h2><p>Implementation steps:</p>
<p>• Feed characterization (peat type — highmoor / transitional / lowmoor; moisture; ash; humic content)</p>
