<p>• Confirmation of humic / wax / bitumen yields as separable products</p>
<p>• Patent filing on the integrated peat-vacuum-biorefinery configuration</p></section>
<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Market Potential</h2><p>Addressable markets:</p>
<p>• Russian peat reserves (175 bln t) — largest untapped solid-fuel resource</p>
<p>• Belarus, Finland, Ireland, Estonia, Sweden — established peat consumers</p>
<p>• Indonesia (tropical peat) — climate-sensitive but very large resource</p>
