            '_arbok_technology_type' => 'Corundum (Al₂O₃) and thermally expanded graphite (TEG) dispersed in glycerine-type polyols to form a shear thickening fluid, used to impregnate woven p-aramid fabric with areal density varied by anatomical zone',
