<p>Remaining: prototype manufacturing (€150k PoC budget), heating/cooling performance validation across ambient temps, efficiency testing (actual vs. claimed 5–7× reduction), automotive integration prototype, commercial unit design, regulatory certifications (safety, performance standards), manufacturing scale-up partnership</p></section>
<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Market Potential</h2><p>Target: HVAC manufacturers (major global players), automotive OEMs (EV thermal management), commercial cooling operators, regional AC distributors. Drivers: R-134a, R-410A phase-out (EU, USA regulations), EV thermal management needs, climate change (higher cooling demand), energy cost reduction, green agenda. Global AC market: ~$100B/year; if ARBOK captures 5–10% = $5–10B potential. Automotive cooling: ~$50B/year; EV segment fast-growing.</p></section>
