<p>• One facility manager and two part-time workers per farm</p>
<p>• Harvest every ~30 days, staggered across modules</p></section>
<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>TRL</h2><p>TRL 4 (concept; hypobaric plant growth validated in laboratory studies); concept documented in an ARBOK preprint (June 2026, Zenodo/ResearchGate, DOI pending).</p>
<p>Evidence:</p>
<p>• Documented growth and full life cycle of crops under sub-atmospheric pressure</p>
