<p>Energy: low specific demand (~0.72 kWh/t), powered by ARBOK&#x27;s own generation — cheaper than solar and 24/7</p>
<p>Water: closed loop, makeup only</p>
<p>Payback: from under 4 months (maximum yield) to ~2.2 years (conservative); ~2.4 years with full renewable autonomy</p>
