<p>Integration with other ARBOK platform technologies follows the same modular logic as the water, biosecurity and energy systems described elsewhere in the ARBOK ecosystem.</p></section>
<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Deployment &amp; Operation</h2><ul>
<li>Target facility scale in the economics: 200–500 rooms or beds.</li>
<li>Reference environmental case: 300 hotel rooms (approximately 600 beds) or a hospital with 300 beds at about 85% load.</li>
