<p>| CAPEX | Up to $10,000,000 (tower + basin + pumping station + installation), long implementation period | $4,000,000–$6,000,000 for comparable duty |</p>
<p>| OPEX at ΔT 16 °C | $5,296,000–$5,712,000 per year | $430,000–$684,000 per year |</p>
