<p>| Annual OPEX saving at ΔT 16 °C | — | $4,612,000–$5,282,000 |</p>
<p>| Annual OPEX saving at ΔT 35–37 °C | — | $10,492,000–$11,162,000 |</p>
<p>| Payback at ΔT 16 °C | — | About 7 years — standard horizon for industrial cooling assets |</p>
<p>| Payback at ΔT 35–37 °C | — | About 7 years; savings exceed $10,000,000 per year |</p>
<p><strong>Classic OPEX breakdown at the reference scale</strong></p>
