<p>OPEX driven by 2–4 kWh/ton energy; no hydrogen/catalyst cost. Revenue from upgraded synthetic fuel plus methane/hydrogen byproducts. CAPEX containerized per 100–150 t/day unit; (site economics by feed and product mix).</p>',
