        'meta' => [
            'problem' => '<p>Finishing rare-earth concentrate recovered from acid mine drainage, phosphogypsum and alumina residue; cobalt, nickel, copper, zinc, manganese, indium, gallium and lead to metal; rhenium, scandium, molybdenum, tellurium, lithium, rubidium, caesium, boron and uranium to their traded salt or oxide.</p>',
