<li>Approximately 85% of supply comes from South Africa; Russia, Zimbabwe and Canada share the remaining 15%.</li>
<li>The US is 100% import-reliant.</li>
<li>Price: approximately $7,250 per troy ounce (July 2026), nearly double the price of gold.</li>
