<p>Steps: survey of port Annex I intake volumes → module sizing → site allocation and pad → installation → commissioning. Installation in weeks, not years. Continuous 24/7 operation, automated, minimal crew. Open air on concrete; heated enclosure in cold climates.</p>
<p>Port reception infrastructure, barges and quayside intake; terminal tank-cleaning operations; EGCS concentrate streams (excluded from the EU indirect fee under Directive 2019/883 and charged separately); refinery gate. Pairs with adjacent ARBOK platforms — ARBOK-VC (Vacuum Cracking), Arbok-VCBC (Bunker Cleaning), ARBOK-Port-Sludge-Cleanup, OILTRAP. SCADA/PLC ready.</p>',
