<p>Industries and users: water utilities, irrigation authorities, remote/arid regions, mining, emergency services, industrial operators.</p>
<p>Scale: modular pipeline with boosters; from local transfers to 1 000+ km lines. Throughput 1–10+ m³/hour per line depending on distance and ejector configuration.</p>',
