        'short_description' => 'ARBOK-Potato applies the Arbok-TRINITY acid agent to protect potato — feeding 1.3 billion people — from a double strike: aphid-borne viruses (PVY mosaic up to 80 % loss, PLRV leaf-roll, plus PVX/PVS/PVA) and the Colorado potato beetle (resistant to 50+ insecticides, defoliation losses 40–80 %, up…',
