            'use_cases' => '<p><strong>Nuclear and thermal power generation.</strong> Retrofit of once-through condenser circuits at plants whose permitted output is constrained by river temperature or flow — the case documented for the 2026 Danube events and the approved forward pipeline of new once-through units on the same river.</p>
