<p>| Service life | 10–20 years; deep-vacuum operation removes the corrosion mechanism that limits conventional plant life |</p>
<p>| Radionuclides (phosphogypsum service) | radium-226 and associated activity report to an immobilised salt fraction, a small share of processed volume |</p>
