<p>| Wash water / grinding effluent | up to 10% of magnet mass |</p>
<p>| Phosphogypsum grade | 0.03–0.4% REO; Pr ≈4–5% of the rare-earth distribution |</p>
<p>| World phosphogypsum flow | ≈250 Mt/year |</p>
<p>| Contained praseodymium (world flow) | ≈30,000 t/year — above total world Pr mine output |</p>
