<p>| Praseodymium metal price | $245.40/kg (2026), +112.65% year on year, +70.30% year to date |</p>
<p>| NdPr oxide benchmark | $133.02/kg, 1 July 2026, +21.4% in one month, yearly high |</p>
<p>| China share | ≈85% of Nd mining, ≈90% of world NdFeB magnet output |</p>
