        'content_html' => '<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Overview</h2><p>ARBOK-RADAR addresses detection and tracking of low-radar-cross-section aerial targets, atmospheric particles, and weather anomalies for defence, border-surveillance, aviation, and maritime users.</p>
<p>The technology is grounded in ARBOK&#x27;s broader approach: solving detection and sensing problems through superior physics and signal processing rather than added hardware complexity.</p></section>
