        'short_description' => 'ARBOK-Repeel-Locust applies the TRINITY acid agent to desert locust (Schistocerca gregaria), migratory locust (Locusta migratoria), and other acridid grasshoppers.',
        'seo_title' => 'ARBOK-Repeel-Locust (Desert, Migratory, and Grasshopper Control) | ARBOK Technology',
