<p>• Antifungal supply chain: weeks</p>
<p>• Regulatory clearance: 18–36 months in parallel with pilots</p></section>
<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>TRL</h2><p><strong>TRL 5 (confirmed by Michael).</strong> Agent (Arbok-Repeel) field-validated on related chitin pests; wheat-specific field validation pending.</p>
