        'short_description' => 'ARBOK-STEALTH CABLE (ASC) is an advanced cable-level security technology that eliminates electromagnetic (EM) data leakage and signal interception by replacing passive metallic shielding with an active, absorbing graphene-like nanocarbon protective layer fully integrated into the polymer cable wrap.',
        'seo_title' => 'ARBOK-STEALTH CABLE (ASC) | ARBOK Technology',
