<p>Industries and users: defense, aerospace, magnet makers, geothermal/utility operators.</p>
<p>Scale: container-class modules; several units at the largest AMD/geothermal sources.</p>
<p>Deployment proceeds from feed assay through recovery configuration, installation on the AMD or geothermal stream, and commissioning. Container-class, automated; several units at the largest sources for strategic volume.</p>
<p>Co-locates with Appalachian AMD, coal basins, and geothermal fields; cascades on the platform with other metal-recovery stages; feeds compact magnet/oxide refining.</p>',
