            'use_cases' => '<p>Primary use cases: silver recovery from acid mine drainage of lead-zinc and copper mines; plating and electronics rinse and etching liquors; photoprocessing and medical X-ray fixers; copper anode slime liquors and refinery effluent. <strong>Fifth stream (2026-08): end-of-life photovoltaic module recycling — leach liquors, barren solutions after electrowinning, flotation process water. See ARBOK PV-Silver.</strong></p>
