<p>Commercial sequence: begin with reagent sales, which carry no pharmaceutical regulation → monetize the first 10–50 grams at an estimated $10–15 million gross → reinvest in a GMP reactor line and IND submission → enter longevity, regenerative medicine and personalized therapy.</p>
