<p>Built on ARBOK-VC (Vacuum Cracking). Bulk companions: ARBOK-FERTILIZER (blended from phosphate residue and organics, 2 kWh/t, 10 % P₂O₅ / 4–5 % N / 20 % organic carbon, 70–200 $/t, TRL 9) and ARBOK-SAPROPEL (up to 200 t/day feedstock, up to 100× lower energy than thermal drying). Water enabler: ARBOK-OASIS (200 t/day desalination, saline-well recovery in 2–6 weeks). Adjacent: ARBOK Irrigation · AgroSpark · ARBOK-AgroVac · Carbon Farming.</p>',
