        'short_description' => 'Zirconium and hafnium are chemical twins born in the same zircon sand, yet the nuclear industry needs them apart: zirconium cleaner than 100 ppm Hf for neutron-transparent fuel cladding, and hafnium — the neutron absorber — for control rods, superalloys, and the HfO₂ gate dielectrics of advanced AI…',
