<p>Scale: 4 m² home to 50 m²+ industrial systems.</p>
<p>Steps: size collector area → install transparent-tube collector + TEG nanofluid → connect to tank → operate. Minimal maintenance (no corrosion/antifreeze); retrofit or new.</p>
