            'use_cases' => '<p>Grid-scale storage and peak shaving; standby reserve; stabilization of grid fluctuations, where near-zero activation delay matters; distributed storage installed at the point of consumption — buildings, industrial plants, data centres, transport infrastructure. Designed to close the gaps batteries cannot cover, serving cases where instant response, long life and low operating cost matter most, rather than to replace every battery.</p>
