        'seo_description' => 'Arbok-PO replaces the conventional palm oil mill with deep-vacuum thermodynamic separation.',
        'content_html' => '<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Overview</h2><p>Arbok-PO replaces the conventional palm oil mill with deep-vacuum thermodynamic separation. Fresh fruit bunches are ground, mixed with water and processed under deep vacuum at ambient temperature — the water evaporates and the oil separates without heat, steam, solvents or reagents.</p>
<p>The economics change on two axes at once. CAPEX falls 2.7 times and OPEX 33 times: $3 per tonne against $100 for a traditional plant. At the same time yield rises — 59.4 tonnes of oil per day per unit against 53 for the equivalent conventional throughput — and the oil is cleaner, with low acidity, retaining carotenes and tocopherols that thermal processing destroys.</p>
<p>The waste side disappears entirely: no POME wastewater, no methane, no emissions. Water is recycled and dry residue becomes bio-coal or feed.</p></section>
<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Applications</h2><p>Palm oil production: crude palm oil and palm kernel oil for food, cosmetics and biofuels.</p>
<p>Byproduct utilization: dry residue as bio-coal or animal feed; water reused within production.</p>
<p>Scalable deployment: from small farms to large plantations; five units match a traditional plant at 1,080 tonnes FFB/day.</p></section>
<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Operating Principle</h2><p>Fresh fruit bunches are ground and mixed with water, then processed under deep vacuum at ambient temperature. Under reduced pressure the water evaporates and the oil separates — without heating, which is what preserves carotenes and tocopherols and keeps acidity low.</p>
<p>Outputs per batch: 22 % crude palm oil, 5.5 % palm kernel oil, clean water and dry residue.</p>
<p>The process handles FFB without pre-separation. It uses no steam, no solvents and no reagents. Operation is fully automated with sensors for pressure, temperature and level, running 24/7 with maintenance limited to pump checks and residue unloading. One operator per unit.</p></section>
<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Key Parameters</h2><p>| Parameter | Arbok-PO | Traditional plant |</p>
<p>|---|---|---|</p>
<p>| Process temperature | ambient, deep vacuum | thermal, with steam |</p>
