<p>| Energy consumption | 5 kWh/t | 15–20 kWh/t |</p>
<p>| Footprint | 20 m² (vertical 20-ft tank) | — |</p>
<p>| Five-unit equivalent | 1,080 t FFB/day | 1,080 t FFB/day |</p>
