            'use_cases' => '<p>Agricultural fertilization: nutrient-rich organomineral fertilizer for crops, improving soil fertility and water retention across diverse climates and soil types. Field-tested on soybean, wheat and corn in Florida, Iowa and Nebraska.</p>
