<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Market Potential</h2><p>[требует уточнения из базы]</p>
<p>The addressable case is every existing installation that rejects heat: boilers, furnaces, turbines, engines, air conditioners and refrigeration plant, plus autonomous heat and power for buildings and vehicles.</p></section>
