<p>Compatible with ARBOK energy modules and ARBOK digital monitoring systems; integration pathway for lightweight structural materials. Positioned within the broader ARBOK ecosystem so that combined deployment gives unified diagnostics and scalable aerial system architecture across industrial and mobility applications.</p>',
