<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Market Potential</h2><p>Off-grid and marine power without fuel logistics is a large market in remote regions, islands, and developing economies, plus autonomous marine power — where DEKA&#x27;s fuel-free saltwater operation is a strong fit.</p></section>
<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Typical Project Economics</h2><p>Electricity cost 3–100× below combustion generators; install cost 5–10× below comparable solar/wind; dominant cost is the long-life cartridge (negligible per kWh). Business model: generator sales + proprietary cartridge supply. (Per-site economics by load and config.)</p></section>
