        'short_description' => 'ARBOK-LAMPCORE is a speculative but physically viable initiative to construct the world\'s fastest brute-force supercomputer entirely based on vacuum tubes, not transistors.',
        'seo_title' => 'ExaFLOP (ARBOK-LAMPCORE) | ARBOK Technology',
