        'short_description' => 'FRACO is a patented coffee processing technology that fractionates green coffee beans (before roasting) into 2–5 components differentiated by density and internal anatomy (not size or origin), roasts each fraction separately at its optimal temperature (light 195–205 °C, dense 210–225 °C), and…',
