        'content_html' => '<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Overview</h2><p>NEROTRONIC desalinates seawater by combining two principles that are not normally used together: thermodynamic evaporative cooling and plasma pulse technology. The combination makes the process fast and energy-efficient, producing clean drinking water and dry salt.</p>
