<p>| Revenue at €0.10/kg | €150,000 |</p>
<p>| OPEX + CAPEX amortization | €960 |</p>
<p>| <strong>Net profit</strong> | <strong>~€149,000/year</strong> |</p>
<p><strong>1,000-unit hub:</strong></p>
<p>| Item | Value |</p>
<p>|---|---|</p>
<p>| Annual output | 1.5 billion kg N₂ |</p>
<p>| Revenue at €0.10/kg | €150 million |</p>
