<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Market Potential</h2><p>Target: urban centers, food-insecure regions, cold-climate countries, premium fresh produce markets. Drivers: urbanization (2 billion people in cities by 2050), climate change (unpredictable field harvests), supply chain volatility, consumer demand for pesticide-free/local produce. Global CEA market: $5–8B in 2026, growing 10–15% annually, projected $15–30B by 2035.</p></section>
