<p>| Breakdown products | amino acids, absorbed without fat deposition |</p>
<p>| Targets | low-density and very-low-density lipoproteins |</p>
<p>| Form factor | comparable to a conventional microwave oven |</p>
<p>| Deployment | household and food service |</p>
