<section class="arbok-imported-section"><h2>Advantages</h2><p>Acts on finished dishes rather than requiring reformulation of recipes or substitution of ingredients — the food is cooked normally.</p>
<p>No change to texture, taste, colour or aroma, which is the failure point of conventional low-fat cooking and fat substitutes.</p>
<p>One-minute cycle at unchanged food temperature, so the dish is not re-heated or re-cooked.</p>
<p>Converts fat into amino acids rather than merely removing it, so the nutritional mass is retained in a form the body absorbs without deposition.</p>
<p>Enables a commercial product category — 0 % FAT menus — for restaurants and food service.</p></section>
